{{!--
  customization-bay.hbs
  Standalone frame for CustomizationBayApp (Phase 2 structural flattening).

  Wraps the canonical partials/customization-bay-content.hbs partial in the
  standalone-only device frame chrome (outer border, glow, screen-fill
  background, framing padding, window min/max sizing, full-surface
  scanline) needed when the Bay renders as its own ApplicationV2 window.
  The Holopad-hosted path (templates/shell/partials/surface-customization.hbs,
  via CustomizationSurfaceAdapter) renders the exact same content partial
  directly, with no wrapper at all — the Holopad is already the outer
  device frame there, so Garage/Shipyard never repaints a second one. There
  is only one canonical Garage/Shipyard content source; standalone and
  inline differ only by frame ownership, not by markup.
--}}
<div class="swse-customization-bay-standalone-frame" data-motion-style="{{motionStyle}}">
  {{> "systems/foundryvtt-swse/templates/apps/customization/partials/customization-bay-content.hbs"}}
</div>
